    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$6x^{2}+38x+40$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2(3x+4)(x+5)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=60$, $S=19$, $F=15,4$.\n$$\\begin{align*}6x^{2}+38x+40&=2(3x^{2}+19x+20)\\\\&=2(3x^{2}+15x+4x+20)\\\\&=2[3x(x+5)+4(x+5)]\\\\&=2(3x+4)(x+5)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$6x^{2}-15x-36$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3(2x+3)(x-4)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=-24$, $S=-5$, $F=-8,3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}6x^{2}-15x-36&=3(2x^{2}-5x-12)\\\\&=3(2x^{2}-8x+3x-12)\\\\&=3[2x(x-4)+3(x-4)]\\\\&=3(2x+3)(x-4)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$48x^{2}-18x-3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3(8x+1)(2x-1)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=-16$, $S=-6$, $F=-8,2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}48x^{2}-18x-3&=3(16x^{2}-6x-1)\\\\&=3(16x^{2}-8x+2x-1)\\\\&=3[8x(2x-1)+(2x-1)]\\\\&=3(8x+1)(2x-1)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$32x^{2}-88x+60$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4(4x-5)(2x-3)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=120$, $S=-22$, $F=-12,-10$.\n$$\\begin{align*}32x^{2}-88x+60&=4(8x^{2}-22x+15)\\\\&=4(8x^{2}-12x-10x+15)\\\\&=4[4x(2x-3)-5(2x-3)]\\\\&=4(4x-5)(2x-3)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$16x^{2}-24x+8$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$8(2x-1)(x-1)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=2$, $S=-3$, $F=-2,-1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}16x^{2}-24x+8&=8(2x^{2}-3x+1)\\\\&=8(2x^{2}-2x-x+1)\\\\&=8[2x(x-1)-(x-1)]\\\\&=8(2x-1)(x-1)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$90x^{2}+90x-100$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10(3x-2)(3x+5)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=-90$, $S=9$, $F=15,-6$.\n$$\\begin{align*}90x^{2}+90x-100&=10(9x^{2}+9x-10)\\\\&=10(9x^{2}+15x-6x-10)\\\\&=10[3x(3x+5)-2(3x+5)]\\\\&=10(3x-2)(3x+5)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p53-q7-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$-50x^{2}-115x-60$",
