        "answer": {
          "short": "$-5(5x+4)(2x+3)$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=120$, $S=23$, $F=15,8$.\n$$\\begin{align*}-50x^{2}-115x-60&=-5(10x^{2}+23x+12)\\\\&=-5(10x^{2}+15x+8x+12)\\\\&=-5[5x(2x+3)+4(2x+3)]\\\\&=-5(5x+4)(2x+3)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
