        "answer": {
          "short": "$3(2x-3)^{2}$",
          "worked": "For the trinomial inside the brackets, $P=36$, $S=-12$, $F=-6,-6$.\n$$\\begin{align*}12x^{2}-36x+27&=3(4x^{2}-12x+9)\\\\&=3(4x^{2}-6x-6x+9)\\\\&=3[2x(2x-3)-3(2x-3)]\\\\&=3(2x-3)(2x-3)\\\\&=3(2x-3)^{2}\\end{align*}$$",
